(x)$ about $x=-2$ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{P}_{3}(x) & =f(-2)+{f}^{′}(-2)(x+2)+\\frac{{f}^{″}(-2)}{2!}(x+2)^{2}+\\frac{{f}^{‴}(-2)}{3!}(x+2)^{3} \\\\  & =f(-2)+{f}^{′}(-2)(x+2)+\\frac{{f}^{″}(2)}{2}(x+2)^{2}+\\frac{{f}^{‴}(-2)}{6}(x+2)^{3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe have been given the following set of values: \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(-2) & =3 \\\\ {f}^{′}(-2) & =5 \\\\ {f}^{″}(-2) & =-8 \\\\ {f}^{‴}(-2) & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting the given values into our Taylor polynomial, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{P}_{3}(x) & =3+5(x+2)+\\frac{-8}{2}(x+2)^{2}+\\frac{0}{6}(x+2)^{3} \\\\  & =3+5(x+2)-4(x+2)^{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535260 true] [17592186340429 1000 #edb/ref 17592186340430 13194139535260 true] [17592186340429 1000 #edb/ref 17592186340431 13194139535260 true] [17592186340429 1000 #edb/ref 17592186340432 13194139535260 true] [17592186340429 1000 #edb/ref 17592186340433 13194139535260 true] [17592186340429 1000 #edb/ref 17592186340434 13194139535260 true] [17592186340429 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535260 true] [17592186340429 1041 "selection" 13194139535260 true] [17592186340429 1104 #edb/ref 17592186340433 13194139535260 true] [17592186340429 1110 #uuid "f0fe6001-0c14-5d20-9880-f98f67d3f814" 13194139535260 true] [17592186340430 1034 "3+5(x+2)-8(x+2)^{2}" 13194139535260 true] [17592186340430 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535260 true] [17592186340430 1111 #uuid "52ba7736-d88d-59ad-b210-ee6a42195079" 13194139535260 true] [17592186340431 1034 "3+5(x-2)-8(x-2)^{2}" 13194139535260 true] [17592186340431 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535260 true] [17592186340431 1111 #uuid "7dd47933-e029-596c-8e31-b5e501eff97a" 13194139535260 true] [17592186340432 1034 "3+5(x+2)-(x+2)^{2}" 13194139535260 true] [17592186340432 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535260 true] [17592186340432 1111 #uuid "cdedd75a-3353-55da-9ea9-8dc15556a102" 13194139535260 true] [17592186340433 1034 "3+5(x+2)-4(x+2)^{2}" 13194139535260 true] [17592186340433 1103 #